    location: 'Upper Village, 93108',
    quote: 'Old built-in frosting up inside, top shelf warm',
    description: "A 500-series side-by-side from a '90s remodel — the estate manager told us honestly that nobody remembered its last service. Classic pattern for the series: worn defrost components icing the evaporator until airflow died. Artur restored the defrost function, replaced the door gasket that had been letting humid air feed the frost, cleaned a badly loaded condenser, and left a written service record so the next tech isn't starting blind.",
    outcome: '✓ Same day · Defrost restored · Service record established'
  },
  {
    appliance: 'Wolf Range',
    location: 'Hedgerow district, 93108',
